! Summary
Projects group actions, subprojects and references. A project is any tiddler tagged `$:/GSD/Project`.

! Detail

!! Field Variables

| !Field | !Values | !Note |
|gsd_status |active |Shipped set: hardcoded in [[$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/modules/status-sets]] — replace it wholesale to swap the vocabulary (see the Action page's Custom statuses) |
|~|future |A future project hides its children from `future-items-sweep` lists |
|gsd_complete |false | |
|~|true | |
|gsd_comp_date |''TW date string'' | |
|gsd_project |''user-defined'' |Parent project — subprojects nest |

!! UI Controls
The project view template shows Next/Waiting/Future actions, subprojects, references and a lazy Completed section. Panel sections come from [[PanelTemplate|PanelTemplate]]; the panel position defaults to ''bottom''.

! Best Practice
Mark projects `future` to park them: with `$:/config/hypergsd/dashboard-future-project-items` at `hide` (default), their actions leave the dashboards without deleting anything.